{
  "summary": "To print a presentation in LibreOffice Impress, open the print dialog using the File menu or by pressing Ctrl+P. In the General tab under Document, users can select print formats including slides, handouts, notes, and outline. When printing slides, the LibreOffice Impress tab allows customization of content (such as slide name, date and time, and hidden pages), color settings (original color, grayscale, or black and white), and size options like fitting to a printable page. The Page Layout tab enables printing multiple slides per sheet, choosing the number of slides per page, drawing borders around each page, or printing slides as a brochure for binding. For handouts, the default format places four slides per page ordered left to right and then downwards, with size options disabled. When printing notes typed in the slide's Notes tab, the preview displays the note at the bottom of the slide, and size options in the LibreOffice Impress tab are likewise unavailable.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "fact": "A presentation can be printed by selecting File then Print or by pressing the Ctrl and P keys together.",
      "evidence": "file और print पर click करें या फिर ctrl और p कीज़ साथ में press कर सकते हैं"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Under the Document field in the General tab, available presentation print options include slides, handouts, notes, and outline.",
      "evidence": "slides हैण्डआउट्स notes और outline"
    },
    {
      "fact": "In the LibreOffice Impress tab under Content, users can choose to print the slide name, date and time, and hidden pages.",
      "evidence": "content में slide name date and time और hidden pages चुनते हैं"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Selecting the draw a border around each page option creates a black border around each printed page.",
      "evidence": "draw a border around each page option को चुनते हैं यह प्रिंट करते समय प्रत्येक पेज पर एक काला border बनाता है"
    },
    {
      "fact": "The brochure option formats slides to be printed as a booklet suitable for binding.",
      "evidence": "अगला option है brochure यह slides को पुस्तिका के रूप में print करने की सुविधा देता है जो binding के लिए आसान हो"
    },
    {
      "fact": "The default handout configuration places four slides per page ordered from left to right and then down.",
      "evidence": "handout चुनें default रुप से एक पेज पर 4 slides होते हैं और default क्रम है बाएं से दाएं फिर नीचे"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Size options under the LibreOffice Impress tab are disabled when printing handouts because print size is determined by sheet size and slide count.",
      "evidence": "libreoffice impress टैब में आप देखेंगे कि size options चुने हुए नहीं हैं या निष्क्रिय हैं"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Notes for a slide can be added by navigating to the slide and clicking the Notes tab.",
      "evidence": "पहली slide पर जाते हैं और notes टैब पर click करें यहाँ note में हम type करेंगे"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Selecting notes under the Document field displays typed slide notes at the bottom of the slide in the print preview.",
      "evidence": "document field में notes option चुनें बाएं ओर प्रीव्यू पेज पर देखें यह slide के तल पर आपके टाइप किए हुए note दिखाएगा"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Size options in the LibreOffice Impress tab are unavailable when printing notes.",
      "evidence": "ध्यान दें कि जब हम notes print करते हैं उसके लिए size options उपलब्ध नहीं हैं"
    }
  ]
}
